      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A model can use a signum in lieu of making a shooting attack of his own. If he does so, one model in his squad is Ballistic Skill 5 for the remainder of the Shooting phase. Declare that the signum is being used before any rolls to hit are made.</characteristic>
