            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Heavy 4, Blast, Tremor (Any unit hit by a subterranean blast will move as if in difficult terrain in its following Movement phase. If the unit is actually moving through difficult terrain, it rolls one less dice than normal to determine its maximum move. A vehicle hit by a Tremor shell must take a dangerous terrain test if it moves in the following Movement phase. This even applies to skimmers.</characteristic>
